## Maintenance

Update when the active stage order, timing contract, validation gate, artifact handoff, failure boundary, recovery point, or process identity changes. Update `CODE_ARCHITECTURE`, `CURRENT_VERSION`, `SOURCE_OF_TRUTH`, and the artifact registry as well when the same change affects them.
